      banner: 'Canva: 190M+ monthly active users, AI features: Magic Design, text-to-image, background removal, AI writing. US Copyright Office: AI-generated works may lack copyright protection. AI generates design containing trademarked logo. DMCA: platform liability for infringing content. Who owns AI-generated designs? Who is liable for AI trademark infringement?',
